// Sales: what a customer bought. The module EXTENDS the application's sidebar with its own child (Reports).
//
// Sales never reads Storefront's or Warehouse's data. An order arrives as the public OrderPlaced (translated into the private OrderReceived),
// stock outcomes arrive as StockReserved / StockReservationFailed / ShipmentDispatched, price changes as ProductPriceChanged. What Sales says
// about itself leaves as OrderConfirmed (P5) and OrderStatusChanged (P6).
module Orders
  description "Order intake, approval, fulfilment and reporting"
  authorize CanWorkOrders

  navigation sidebar extends
    item reports title "Reports" icon chart target Orders.Reporting

  feature Intake
    description "Orders arrive from the storefront; the price list follows the catalogue"
  feature Approval
    description "Small orders approve themselves, the rest wait for a manager"
  feature Fulfilment
    description "From confirmation through reservation to shipment"
  feature Reporting
    description "Figures for the sales floor and the executive view"
